{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And Isaac was forty years old.</b> Rashi explained that Isaac married Rebekah when she was three years old. And it is difficult, for at the end of Sifrei we conclude: three whose years were equal — Kehat, Rebekah, and Ben Azzai. If so, Rebekah lived 133 years like Kehat, and if she was only three years old when Isaac married her, you will find that she was missing 11 years from their years. How so? He married her at three and she was twenty-three when she gave birth. And if so, when she gave birth to Jacob she was twenty-three, and Jacob was sixty-three when he was blessed, as Rashi explained at the end of this parashah, and 14 years he was hidden in the house of Eber, and 20 years he served in the house of Laban, and two years he delayed on the way, and at that time he was informed of his mother's death, as Rashi explained in parashat Vayishlah by Elon Bakut. And if so, she was only 122 years old. It seems to us that Rebekah was fourteen years old when Isaac married her, and thus it is in Seder Olam, and so said Rabbi Yehudah, and then you will find that she was exactly 133 years. And according to this, what we learned in Seder Olam must be understood: when Abraham returned from the Akedah he was informed that Rebekah was born — she had already been born eleven years earlier. And on this the Rav Moses Solomon bar Abraham, known as Ensiman, raised the difficulty: what is this that we say, we give a virgin twelve months — and it is derived from the verse ״תשב הנערה״ etc. — and how do we find to learn this from Rebekah? She was already a bogeret at that time, and we say there that for a bogeret we give only thirty days, like for a widow. And it requires investigation."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "The comment reports a difficulty with Rashi's view that Rebekah was three at marriage, citing Sifrei's statement that Rebekah lived 133 years like Kehat. 'Ensiman' is a transliterated surname; left as in the original."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:07.108094435Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}